	(text "VREF_TGT comes from the target on J13.1 / J15.1 and sets the level of every translator (TXB0104/TXB0108/TXS0102)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 19.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "439d8fd2-3ec8-5dc4-aa84-20dd9267a1e3")
	)
	(text "OE pins follow VREF_TGT: with the target off the translators are high-impedance. J15 GPIO are push-pull (TXB)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 22.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9ae7f0a8-dff5-5557-a230-de37c2b05a54")
	)
	(text "TXS0102 instead of PCA9306: works with VREF_TGT equal to 3.3 V (PCA9306 needs VREF2 > VREF1). Range 1.65-3.6 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 25.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cb2daadc-55eb-561a-9c6e-6604a36f4534")
	)
	(text "TPS26630: ILIM 6.04k -> 3 A (RILIM = 18 kOhm.A / IOL; 3.65k -> 5 A until 2026-10-10, when the 20 W inlet set the budget), UVLO 196k/75k -> 4.3 V, OVP/MODE/PGTH to GND (latch-off). IMON 20k -> 1.7 V at 3 A into PTB2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 27.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d741ed37-e1df-5126-b3f2-570816912255")
	)
